{"abstract":"Antimicrobial resistance (AMR) is a major threat to global health. Understanding the emergence, evolution, and transmission of individual antibiotic resistance genes (ARGs) is essential to develop sustainable strategies combatting this threat. Here, we use metagenomic sequencing to analyse ARGs in 757 sewage samples from 243 cities in 101 countries, collected from 2016 to 2019. We find regional patterns in resistomes, and these differ between subsets corresponding to drug classes and are partly driven by taxonomic variation. The genetic environments of 49 common ARGs are highly diverse, with most common ARGs carried by multiple distinct genomic contexts globally and sometimes on plasmids. Analysis of flanking sequence revealed ARG-specific patterns of dispersal limitation and global transmission. Our data furthermore suggest certain geographies are more prone to transmission events and should receive additional attention.","author_count":50,"contributors":["Munk, Patrick","Brinch, Christian","Møller, Frederik Duus","Petersen, Thomas N.","Hendriksen, Rene S.","Seyfarth, Anne Mette","Kjeldgaard, Jette S.","Svendsen, Christina Aaby","van Bunnik, Bram","Berglund, Fanny","Bego, Artan","Power, Pablo","Rees, Catherine","Lambrinidis, Dionisia","Neilson, Elizabeth Heather Jakobsen","Gibb, Karen","Coventry, Kris","Collignon, Peter","Cassar, Susan","Allerberger, Franz","Begum, Anowara","Hossain, Zenat Zebin","Worrell, Carlon","Vandenberg, Olivier","Pieters, Ilse","Victorien, Dougnon Tamègnon","Gutierrez, Angela Daniela Salazar","Soria, Freddy","Grujić, Vesna Rudić","Mazalica, Nataša","Rahube, Teddie O.","Tagliati, Carlos Alberto","Rodrigues, Dalia","Oliveira, Guilherme","de Souza, Larissa Camila Ribeiro","Ivanov, Ivan","Juste, Bonkoungou Isidore","Oumar, Traoré","Sopheak, Thet","Vuthy, Yith","Ngandijo, Antoinette","Nzouankeu, Ariane","Olivier, Ziem A.Abah Jacques","Yost, Christopher K.","Hansen, Lisbeth Truelstrup","Jensen, Pernille Erland","Parimannan, Sivachandran","Hounmanou, Yaovi Mahuton Gildas","Thomsen, Jens","Aarestrup, Frank M."],"cuid":["S02-088.89-035450"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Africa","America, Central","America, North","America, South","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corpau":["Global Sewage Surveillance Consortium"],"corresponding_author":["Munk, Patrick"],"country":["Albania","Argentina","Australia","Austria","Bangladesh","Barbados","Belgium","Benin","Bolivia","Bosnia and Herzegovina","Botswana","Brazil","Bulgaria","Burkina Faso","Cambodia","Cameroon","Canada","Malaysia","Netherlands","Sweden","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["ALS Water","All Global Affiliations","Aquafin, Belgium","Asian Institute of Medicine, Science and Technology","Austrian Agency for Health and Food Safety GmbH","Botswana International University of Science and Technology","Bridgetown","Canberra Hospital","Centre Pasteur du Cameroun","Charles Darwin University","Erasmus University Medical Center","Fundação Oswaldo Cruz","Institut Pasteur du Cambodge","Institute of Public Health Albania","Instituto Tecnológico Vale","Laboratoire Hospitalier Universitaire de Bruxelles (LHUB-ULB)","National Center of Infectious and Parasitic Diseases Bulgaria","Polytechnic School of Abomey-Calavi (EPAC)","Public Health Institute of the Republic of Srpska","State Government of Victoria","Universidad Catσlica Boliviana San Pablo","Universidad de Buenos Aires","Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais","University of Banja Luka","University of Dhaka","University of Edinburgh","University of Gothenburg","University of Regina","Université de Ouagadougou"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Abu Dhabi Public Health Center"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genomic analysis of sewage from 000000000101 countries reveals global landscape of antimicrobial resistance","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-34312-7","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-088.89-035450","identifier":[{"id":"PMC9715550","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85143185703","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36456547","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-7cd867a3-ccff-418c-ad8f-39766fe57b6b","ku-c8e81d5d-3fa6-4080-91c2-771d00788678"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8AC98FC687CECA9A5EFA3E10AC19FF15"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-022-34312-7","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/338774732/Fulltext.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/298174245/s41467_022_34312_7.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute, Research Group for Genomic Epidemiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of edinburgh","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Edinburgh","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"university of gothenburg","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"