{"abstract":"In this article, we outline an exploratory framework that attempts to capture different types of scaling practices in urban space. \"Scaling\" in this context is understood as a concept that involves a temporary intervention in public space that negotiates agency among human and non- human actors. The aim of this framework is to assist curators and researchers in conceptualizing site-specific interventions or exhibitions in urban contexts.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Knutz, Eva","Dankl, Kathrina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-129166"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-ART","DI-U"],"level3":{"ART":["DI-ART-ALL","DI-ART-DSKD"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-ART-DSKD","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"scaling experiments in urban space an exploratory framework","src":["arkk"],"src-code":["DI-ART-DSKD"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://conference2021nordes.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/final_Nordes-2021-Proceeding_jan22.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-129166","ids":["arkk-bb09a411-cd31-433d-9523-d35bcb52ce1d"],"keyword":["No"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2F8FD2E107984B3A7C6B0ABC3375F855"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://conference2021nordes.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/final_Nordes-2021-Proceeding_jan22.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Syddansk Universitet, Kolding Campus"],"nora_code":